**4. Added string** `error_invalid_number` ("Invalid number") to `values/strings_main.xml`, alongside the existing `error_invalid_secret`. Only the default locale is added — translations fall back to it automatically.

One incidental improvement: a lone `-` (permitted by `android:inputType="number"`) also used to crash the watcher and is now handled by the same path.
